						aware of a copyright infringement, please inform us accordingly. Upon becoming aware of legal violations, 
						we will remove such content immediately.
					</p>
				</section>
			</main>

			<footer>
				<p>Last updated: March 2026</p>
			</footer>
		</div>
		<Footer client:load left={[{ href: '/', label: 'Home' }]} right={[{ href: '/privacy', label: 'Privacy' }]} />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.impress-container {
		max-width: 800px;
		width: 100%;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 3rem 2rem;
		color: #f8fafc;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	header {
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
		border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
		padding-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #fff;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, #8b5cf6 100%);
		-webkit-background-clip: text;
		-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
		background-clip: text;
	}

	main {
		margin-bottom: 4rem;
	}

	section {
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #fff;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	p {
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		color: #cbd5e1;
	}

	strong {
		color: #e0e7ff;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	a {
		color: #8b5cf6;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.2s;
	}

	a:hover {
		color: #a78bfa;
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	footer {
		border-top: 2px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
		padding-top: 2rem;
		text-align: center;
		color: #94a3b8;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.impress-container {
			padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: 2rem;
		}

		h2 {
			font-size: 1.25rem;
		}
	}
</style>
